WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.900
Make a tag once with a component; props give each copy its own data

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.825
An empty app.

3
00:00:07.251 --> 00:00:10.601
A component: a tag of our own called player-card.

4
00:00:11.303 --> 00:00:14.753
Its prop, name, is the data each copy is given.

5
00:00:15.404 --> 00:00:18.754
Use the tag twice, with a different name each time.

6
00:00:22.693 --> 00:00:26.293
Written once, used twice, each copy with its own name.
